  "mn134:2.11": "This suggests that Candana was one of the Thirty-three. In the Chinese parallels, however, he heard this at Rājagaha. | This tree forms the basis for an elaborate simile for renunciation at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an7.69/en/sujato'>AN 7.69</a>. | <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Paṇḍukambala</i> is a kind of luxury upholstery. ",
